  constructor
  · intro A hA B hB a b ha hb hab
    convert! (hA.smul ha).add (hB.smul hb) using 1
  · intro A hA B hB a b ha hb hab
    have hi := (OpenAIEntropy.concaveOn_entropy (ι := k)).2 hA hB ha hb hab
