    B 0 1 * B 1 0 - C 0 1 * A 1 0) * X ^ 2 +
  Polynomial.C (B 0 0 * C 1 1 + C 0 0 * B 1 1 - B 0 1 * C 1 0 - C 0 1 * B 1 0) * X +
